      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just a bit worried about calling the doctor every time i add a supplement, it's kind of a hassle. i mean, vitamin k is just a natural vitamin, right? it's not like a heavy drug. surely a little bit extra won't really mess up my blood thinning that much? it's mostly for my bones anyway.",
