      "content": "i hear you, but i've actually been feeling fine, no weird symptoms or anything. if i just keep my dose of the vitamin k consistent every single morning, won't my body just adjust to it? i don't want to deal with the whole doctor visit thing if it's just a little bit of a vitamin. can't i just watch how i feel and keep going with it?",
